							declaration is done after component initialization. Databinding still doesn't happen, but compiler
							warning is avoided.
							
							I am presuming that the actual intent here was not to databind but just an assignment of value.
							-->
							<mx:Image initialize="im1.source=outerDocument.magGlass" scaleContent="false" 
									  click="outerDocument.clickQuery(data)" id="im1"/>				
						</mx:VBox>
